227 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (According to a survey from the Digital Education Council, 24% of students globally use AI daily, and 54% use it at least weekly. ChatGPT is the most commonly used AI tool, reported by 66% of respondents \(Kelly, 24\). In June 2023, the ACT conducted a survey of 4006 students from grades 10 to 12, which showed that 46% of students use AI tools for school assignments. The main reasons for students not using them were lack of interest, trust, and not knowing enough about it. Although less than half of students use AI tools for school, these tools have a significant impact on students' academic achievement. 53% of students with ACT composite scores in the top quarter used AI tools, compared with 36% of those in the bottom quarter \(ACT, 23\).)
/E (According to a survey from the Digital Education Council, 24% of students globally use AI daily, and 54% use it at least weekly. ChatGPT is the most commonly used AI tool, reported by 66% of respondents \(Kelly, 24\). In June 2023, the ACT conducted a survey of 4006 students from grades 10 to 12, which showed that 46% of students use AI tools for school assignments. The main reasons for students not using them were lack of interest, trust, and not knowing enough about it. Although less than half of students use AI tools for school, these tools have a significant impact on students' academic achievement. 53% of students with ACT composite scores in the top quarter used AI tools, compared with 36% of those in the bottom quarter \(ACT, 23\).)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2 3 4]
>>
