273 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (Although AI is a powerful and generally accessible tool, school districts with lesser funding, especially in areas where families may not be technologically literate or have the financial means to access AI \(e.g. they lack a stable internet connection or cannot afford hardware capable of running modern AI-powered applications\), will fall behind other, wealthier areas, furthering inequities in education. For a successful program to be implemented, inequity of access to AI technologies and supplementary technologies, like computers and internet, must also be considered.)
/E (Although AI is a powerful and generally accessible tool, school districts with lesser funding, especially in areas where families may not be technologically literate or have the financial means to access AI \(e.g. they lack a stable internet connection or cannot afford hardware capable of running modern AI-powered applications\), will fall behind other, wealthier areas, furthering inequities in education. For a successful program to be implemented, inequity of access to AI technologies and supplementary technologies, like computers and internet, must also be considered.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
