/P 691 0 R
/ActualText (AI Plagiarism: One core ethical issue with AI is its potential to reproduce data without proper credit, essentially engaging in unintentional plagiarism. Teaching students how AI models are trained on large datasets will expose the lack of transparency in data sourcing, thus fostering awareness)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
292 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 692 0 R
/ActualText (Consent and Understanding: The goal here is to educate students and schools on responsibly engaging with AI. By understanding the implications of using AI, users can make informed, consensual choices about what data they share and how AI utilizes it.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [4]
>>
