<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (Broadening Access: Current AI educational frameworks often focus on higher education, which limits secondary school students' access to vital AI knowledge. Expanding this to secondary schools ensures that a broader segment of students gains the technical and ethical skills needed to navigate an AI-driven world.)
/E (Broadening Access: Current AI educational frameworks often focus on higher education, which limits secondary school students' access to vital AI knowledge. Expanding this to secondary schools ensures that a broader segment of students gains the technical and ethical skills needed to navigate an AI-driven world.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
