/P 693 0 R
/ActualText (Bridging the Gap: There is a significant knowledge gap regarding AI between high school students and undergraduates. Your co-op model closes this gap by creating opportunities for undergraduate students to mentor and teach secondary students.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
