/T (National Institute of Standards and Technology \(NIST\): Development of AI standards and benchmarks for educational tools. Office of Educational Technology \(OET\): Coordination of AI initiatives in line with national technology policies. National Science Foundation \(NSF\): Grant support and research on AI-driven personalized learning. Institute of Education Sciences \(IES\): Evaluation and research on the impact of AI on learning outcomes. Office for Civil Rights \(OCR\): Ensuring AI tools are equitable and accessible for all students. Non-Governmental Organizations \(NGOs\): Engage educational NGOs to develop content and provide additional funding or expertise: 501\(c\)\(3\) aiEDU, Team4Tech, Educational Testing Service \(ETS\))
/E (National Institute of Standards and Technology \(NIST\): Development of AI standards and benchmarks for educational tools. Office of Educational Technology \(OET\): Coordination of AI initiatives in line with national technology policies. National Science Foundation \(NSF\): Grant support and research on AI-driven personalized learning. Institute of Education Sciences \(IES\): Evaluation and research on the impact of AI on learning outcomes. Office for Civil Rights \(OCR\): Ensuring AI tools are equitable and accessible for all students. Non-Governmental Organizations \(NGOs\): Engage educational NGOs to develop content and provide additional funding or expertise: 501\(c\)\(3\) aiEDU, Team4Tech, Educational Testing Service \(ETS\))
