/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Through the B.R.A.I.N.S Framework, and specifically through programs the co-op program and AI-enhanced lesson plan repository, we can ensure AI-powered educational resources are distributed accessibly and equitably, allowing previously underserved and underresourced communities to have the same level of access to epistemic resources as privileged communities.  )
/E (Through the B.R.A.I.N.S Framework, and specifically through programs the co-op program and AI-enhanced lesson plan repository, we can ensure AI-powered educational resources are distributed accessibly and equitably, allowing previously underserved and underresourced communities to have the same level of access to epistemic resources as privileged communities.  )
