/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Additionally, creating tools like the AI Equity Audit Tool, we provide an institutional check on the implicit biases of AI not only in the educational setting but of AI as a whole. In both the educational and broader social spheres, institutionalized biases that often are pushed onto students during formative years can be diminished over time through these tools, combating common prejudiced stereotypes in America.)
/E (Additionally, creating tools like the AI Equity Audit Tool, we provide an institutional check on the implicit biases of AI not only in the educational setting but of AI as a whole. In both the educational and broader social spheres, institutionalized biases that often are pushed onto students during formative years can be diminished over time through these tools, combating common prejudiced stereotypes in America.)
/Alt ()
